    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so if the electrostatic repulsion is getting weaker, what are my other options for stabilizing the interface? i can't really increase the lecithin concentration much more due to cost, and i need to keep the acidity high for flavor/safety. are there specific hydrocolloids that would help bolster the steric hindrance?",
